janus_biometrics — third-party model attribution
=================================================

This library loads (but does not vendor) the following pre-trained model
weights. None of the weight files are stored in this repository; they are
downloaded on demand (with sha256 verification, see models.py) or supplied
locally by the operator via `local_path` (see models.yaml). This NOTICE
exists to satisfy the attribution terms of the licenses below, per
Section 4(d) of the Apache License, Version 2.0.

